Bind Npc 24406 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14406 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 477 "[Repeatable Solo] Phantom Hunt"
    Repeat always
    Journal for karus "[Imperial Guard] Bekar has commissioned you to hunt Phantom. However, it will not count when you are in a party."
    Journal for elmorad "[Imperial Guard] Telson has commissioned you to hunt Phantom. However, it will not count when you are in a party."
    Kill 30 of 1271, 1272 at direction_702

Requires player level >= 57

Rewards
    Give 2500000 experience or 3750000 with premium

direction_702 = location "Phantom" about "Phantom\nAncient Spirit that stalks the Abyss Dungeon." found "It wanders from Delos Castle to Abyss Dungeon." at 260 621 in zone 30

On available
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master. [Imperial Palace Guard] Telson is about to go on a hunt, so how about joining him?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Would you like to join the Phantom Hunt?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The Phantom is in the Hell Abyss of Delos Abyss Dungeon. Return from the hunt and the Transformation Magic Scroll is yours.\n\n[Imperial Guard] Bekar will reward you when you complete the Phantom Hunt,"
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Would you like to join the Phantom Hunt?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The Phantom is in the Hell Abyss of Delos Abyss Dungeon. Return from the hunt and the Transformation Magic Scroll is yours.\n\n[Imperial Guard] Telson will reward you when you complete the Phantom Hunt,"

On in_progress
    Say "I heard the Phantom can be found in Hell Abyss of Delos Abyss Dungeon."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_702

On ready
    Say "Phew~ It's done. Let's get out of here. I don't like this eerie feeling..."
    Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Well done. Here's the Transformation Scroll, as promised."

On completed
    Say "Haha. Thank you!"
